      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 109951508,
      "text": "キキョウラン Dianella ensifolia は、キキョウラン属の多年草。紫の花を付け、紫の果実を付ける。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Dianella ensifolia",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dianella_ensifolia",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1354688010,
      "text": "Dianella ensifolia is a flowering plant, of the family Asphodelaceae. It is native to southern China, India, Japan, Madagascar, Malesia, the Pacific Islands, Singapore, Sri Lanka, Taiwan, and tropical Asia. Its common names include umbrella dracaena, common dianella, siak-siak, and flax lily."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Dianella ensifolia",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dianella_ensifolia",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 133672413,
      "text": "Dianella ensifolia es una especie de planta herbácea perteneciente a la familia Xanthorrhoeaceae, en la subfamilia Hemerocallidoideae, que se encuentra en Asia."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Dianella ensifolia",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dianella_ensifolia",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 235023004,
      "text": "Dianella ensifolia est une espèce de plantes à fleurs de la famille des liliacées selon la classification classique de Cronquist (1981). Mais avec la classification phylogénétique APG IV (2016), le genre Dianella se retrouve dans la famille des Asphodelaceae."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Rumput siak-siak",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rumput_siak-siak",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 28498504,
      "text": "Rumput siak siak atau pra kepey dalah tanaman berbunga, dari keluarga Asphodelaceae. Tanaman ini berasal dari Tiongkok bagian selatan, India, Jepang, Madagaskar, Malesia, Kepulauan Pasifik, Singapura, Sri Lanka, Taiwan, dan Asia tropis."
    }
